msgid ""
"There are several open source projects such that use small cpu boards, such "
"as the Teensy USB Development board, to convert MAVLink messages to "
"FrSkySmartPort format so that ArduPilot telemetry can be displayed on an "
"`OpenTX <https://www.open-tx.org/>`__ transmitter."
msgstr ""
"有多个开源项目使用 Teensy USB 开发板等小型 CPU 板将 MAVLink 消息转换为 FrSky SmartPort 格式，从而在 "
"`OpenTX <https://www.open-tx.org/>`__ 遥控器上显示 ArduPilot 数传。"

